+         * The format of the specified version number should be "X.Y.Z",
+         * not "W.X.Y.Z".
+         * @param {string} urlTemplate A string with the template fields
+         *     R1_trim and R2_trim.
+         * @param {string} start Start version string.
+         * @param {string} end End version string.
